{"error_message":"Success","data":{"updated_time":1792937455,"name":"1_evaluationMetric","id":42,"value":"<p>Each sample is scored on two things: whether the agent leaves the app data in the correct final state, and how closely its tool calls match the reference (gold) calls.<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>Metrics<\/p><p>\u2022 <strong>State match:<\/strong> the submitted <i>state_hash<\/i> must equal the gold <i>state_hash<\/i>, otherwise the sample scores 0. Free-text (fuzzy) fields do not affect the hash. The <i>state_hash<\/i> must be computed by the <i>zaic_tools<\/i> environment (<i>env.get_state_hash()<\/i>) and can be reproduced by the organisers, who replay the submitted <i>tool_calls<\/i> in order with the matching version of <i>zaic_tools<\/i>; if the results differ, the organisers' result is final.&nbsp;<\/p><p>\u2022 <strong>Tool-call match:<\/strong> a submitted call matches a gold call when the tool name is the same, every non-fuzzy argument is identical, and every fuzzy argument has token-F1 &gt; 0.6 (after lowercasing and Unicode NFC). Each call can match at most one call; order is not considered.<\/p><p>\u2022<strong> Out-of-scope samples:<\/strong> if the gold list is empty, the sample scores 1 only when the submitted list is also empty.<\/p><p>\u2022 <strong>Missing information:<\/strong> sys.ask_missing_info is scored like any other tool;<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>Formula:&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;If the gold list is empty, the sample scores 1 only when the submitted list is also empty; otherwise it scores 0.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Otherwise (the gold list is not empty):<\/p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAyQAAADaCAYAAABXeobwAAAQAElEQVR4AezdfWgb1\/4\\/24VYKUGANAvm7AbQf9COxtw\/hs07IWOfC3ShAAQpQgAIU2DECDEh2TFezoRTYXAEjGPGcGEDuaBjRr\/ywMxrZXHDmToENEmA2FKAABbZbgAHJdvcAy6dALQg8jSFwqh+p3V0YvOiBVXp5o7SHYh\/3HjS+0QKHsw2d\/4xDnX75futJof27H67X6uE4m4BWWJDDdBbDZ9vhsFnQ+LoLgbv5BRtf\/NYIwNpbG1FXV4\/2b7LQX5x8HVs1pL70wWGpQ129A\